{"name":"Angelic","hex":"#f2dcd7","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Angelic","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A member of the Angelic Sisters of Saint Paul, a Roman Catholic religious order."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Angelic"}],"entries":[{"title":"Angel","blocks":[{"text":"An angel is a spiritual, heavenly, or supernatural entity, often depicted as humanoid with bird-like wings, frequently in the role as a messenger or intermediary between God and humanity in various traditions like the Abrahamic religions. Other roles include protectors and guides for humans, such as guardian angels, and servants of God. In Western belief-systems the term is often used to distinguish benevolent from malevolent intermediary beings."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/02/Angel_of_the_Annunciation_MET_DP167921.jpg/330px-Angel_of_the_Annunciation_MET_DP167921.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angel","wikidata":"Q235113"},{"title":"Angelic (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Angelic was a British trance group featuring Darren Tate, Judge Jules and Jules's wife, Amanda O'Riordan."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angelic_(band)","wikidata":"Q533804"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/Bernhard_Plockhorst_-_Schutzengel.jpg/500px-Bernhard_Plockhorst_-_Schutzengel.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/Bernhard_Plockhorst_-_Schutzengel.jpg/500px-Bernhard_Plockhorst_-_Schutzengel.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Schutzengel (\"Guardian angel\") by Bernhard Plockhorst depicts a guardian angel watching over two children.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABernhard_Plockhorst_-_Schutzengel.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia